@startuml activity-w5-weekly-release
title W5 — Weekly Operational Release
skinparam shadowing false
|Scheduler|
start
repeat :Daily: find weeks whose\nscheduled date has arrived;
  |System|
  :Add week N to Pending Actions;
  |Admin|
  :Open week N;
  if (Escrow balance >= weekly amount\nAND week N-1 proof approved?) then (yes)
    :Sign releaseStage(id, N);
    |Ethereum|
    :Pay weekly amount to fundraiser;\nemit StageReleased;
    |System|
    :week N = released; notify;
    |Fundraiser|
    :Buy items; upload receipt\n+ transfer slip;
    |Admin|
    :Review & sign recordProof;
  else (balance insufficient)
    :Sign markUnfunded(id, N);
    |Ethereum|
    :Skip week; funds carry forward;\nemit StageUnfunded;
    |System|
    :week N = unfunded; notify;
  endif
  |Scheduler|
repeat while (More weeks?) is (yes)
->no;
|Ethereum|
:Leftover balance -> refund pool;
|System|
:status = completed;\nnotify donors if refund available;
stop
note right
  If proof for week N-1 is still pending,
  week N waits in Pending Actions
  (release is blocked by the contract).
end note
@enduml
